Q: Blank Output PDF using FPDF library - codeigniter A: <p>I had the same problem and this was my solution:</p>

<p>Instead of using </p>

<pre><code>$this-&gt;fpdf =new FPDF() 
</code></pre>

<p>I used </p>

<pre><code>$pdf = new FPDF();
</code></pre>

<p>then u can use $pdf->... and not $this->pdf->...</p>

<p>Here is an example:</p>

<pre><code>define('FPDF_FONTPATH',$this-&gt;config-&gt;item('fonts_path'));
$this-&gt;load-&gt;library(array('fpdf','fpdf_rotate','pdf'));
$this-&gt;pdf-&gt;Open();
$pdf = new PDF();
$pdf-&gt;AliasNbPages();
$pdf-&gt;AddPage();
$pdf-&gt;SetFont('Arial', '', 12);
$pdf-&gt;SetDrawColor(0);
$pdf-&gt;MultiCell(100,5,"Test\n line of text");
$pdf-&gt;Output('test.pdf', 'D');
</code></pre>

<p>Works like a charm ;)</p>
